\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>z</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>z</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2&#160;</mn> </msup> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>z</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>z</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>z</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mtext>z</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2&#160;&#160;</mn><mtext>or&#160;</mtext><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mtext>z</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is not unimodular<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>z</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;Point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> lies on a circle of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>"
